    "who are u", "who r u", "what r u", "wat r u", "wat are u",
    "enna panna mudiyum", "yenna panna mudiyum", "unnala enna", "enna help",
    "enna ellam panna mudiyum", "nee yaaru", "நீ யார்", "என்ன செய்ய முடியும்",
    "who r you", "what r you",
